                                         <h2 class="plan_head header_grad">Get Assistance with Personalized Plans</h2>
                                                        <p font-size:="" initial="" sans="" source="" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: " user-select:="">We introduce Care Saksham, a plan dedicated to people with special needs due to ADHD, Down Syndrome, Fragile X Syndrome, Fetal Alcohol Syndrome, and other intellectual disabilities.</p>

<p font-size:="" initial="" sans="" source="" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: " user-select:="">To empower the intellectually disabled, Care Saksham&rsquo;s coverage includes specialised daycare treatments, AYUSH treatment, pre- and post-hospitalisation, etc. The plan also offers coverage for the unique healthcare requirements of the covered individuals.</p>

<p font-size:="" initial="" sans="" source="" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: " user-select:="">We aim to promote equal access to quality healthcare while considering the specific circumstances and challenges faced by people with unique needs.</p>

<h2 class="plan_head header_grad" initial="" sans="" source="" style="color: rgb(19, 109, 163); font-size: 30px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.2; padding-left: 0px; font-family: " user-select:="">Plan Highlights of Care Saksham Health Insurance</h2>

<p font-size:="" initial="" sans="" source="" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: " user-select:="">Care Saksham stands out for the following valuable features:</p>

<ul font-size:="" initial="" sans="" source="" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: " user-select:="">
	<li style="user-select: initial !important;">The plan covers the expenses for listed modern treatments for up to 50% of the Sum Insured.</li>
	<li style="user-select: initial !important;">It covers hospitalisation expenses up to the Sum Insured</li>
	<li style="user-select: initial !important;">Covers up to ₹2000 per hospitalisation for the emergency ground ambulance if prescribed by the doctor.</li>
	<li style="user-select: initial !important;">Expenses incurred for Inpatient Care treatment under Ayurveda, Yoga and Naturopathy, Unani, Siddha and Homeopathy are covered.</li>
	<li style="user-select: initial !important;">Under one policy year, cataract treatment for up to Rs. 40,000/-per eye is covered.</li>
</ul>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="benefitTbls">
	<div class="custom_container">
	<h2 class="plan_head header_grad">Coverage Under Care Saksham</h2>
		<div class="custom_table">
