		<section id="faqs" class="faq_sec">
   <div class="custom_container">
      <div class="faq_heading">
         <h2 class="ins_heading">FAQs About Care Saksham</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="responsive_con">
         <div class="faq_contant">
            <section class="faq_acc">
<h3><span>Q.</span>Is Intellectual Disability Normal?</h3>

<div>
<p>Yes. Around 1-3 per cent of the total global population has an intellectual disability. Experts also suggest that an intellectual condition can be dealt with easily if you regularly track the condition.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3><span>Q.</span>What is the best health insurance for disability?</h3>

<div>
<p class="text-light">Our latest plan, Care Saksham, is one of the smartest plans designed to meet the needs of individuals suffering from intellectual disabilities such as ADHD, Fetal Alcohol Syndrome, Down Syndrome, Fragile X syndrome, etc.</p>
</div>
</section>

<section class="faq_acc">
<h3><span>Q.</span> Can People with Intellectual Diseases get Health Insurance Coverage?</h3>

<div>
<p>Although a few companies may project intellectual disorders as an exclusion, Care&rsquo;s latest plan, &ldquo;Care Saksham&rdquo;, is a health policy that one can opt for the financial security of individuals with intellectual diseases.</p>
</div>
</section>
         </div>
      </div>
   </div>
</section>
            		

		 
